# @name createUserBuro3
POST http://localhost:3000/api/usuarios/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomUsuario": "philipcoulson",
  "mail": "phil.coulson@shield.gov",
  "contrasena": "tahiti123",
  "rol": "BUROCRATA",
  "telefono": "+5555551234"
}

